# The folder above ignores every PNG and names its exceptions one at a time,
# because the default capture writes six frames nobody asked for and an
# untracked file there fails the gate's tree-clean step for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the push. The same rule applies here, and it lands where
# rung-candidates/.gitignore landed: the wide frame is the only one there is.
#
# ONE TICK, ONE CAMERA, THE FRAMING THE GAME SHIPS. Every picture here is tick
# 1546 of the recorded match at -Distance 22 -Width 1600, which is the
# committed match-tick-1546.png's framing and the pitch sweep's. played/ holds
# the shipped anchor and the three anchor candidates at the shipped yaw; the two
# yaw-* directories hold the shipped anchor with the camera swung, which is the
# only way to turn the Mage without touching a binding, since a tower faces its
# target and not a number in a table.
#
# THE WHOLE FOLDER IS TEMPORARY. It is the set of alternatives #284 signs from,
# and it goes when the signing does.
#
#   the commands are in mage-anchor.txt
!played/*.png
!yaw-plus-45/*.png
!yaw-minus-45/*.png
